        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market charming 4-bedroom detached bungalow situated on a site of approx. 0.2 acres.\r\n\r\nIdeally located in the heart of Frenchpark village, the property is within walking distance of all local amenities, including the church, school, shop/filling station, and sporting facilities. Conveniently positioned just off the N5, it is only 10 minutes from Boyle, 15 minutes from Castlerea and Ballaghaderreen, and approx. 40 minutes from Ireland West Airport Knock.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this lovely home would make an ideal family residence, retirement home, or investment opportunity.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only.\r\n\r\nServices: Mains water, electricity. \r\n\r\nHeating: Oil-Fired Central heating.\r\n\r\nSewerage: Newly installed septic tank."
      },
